{"parentUuid":"fbf67a84-389b-49a4-9d9a-edfd2eee5f42","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ada7827e69a1c72f9","message":{"id":"21c24c27-4b80-43aa-b45e-b8d8da06b7de","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've started implementing the Model Development stream (PRD A-04 through A-06):\n\n**Completed so far:**\n1. Created model training script at `data/train_models.py` that:\n   - Loads training data from `data/replay/hi_small_train.csv`\n   - Creates mock \"raw-gbm-v1\" and \"gfp-gbm-v1\" models using GradientBoostingClassifier\n   - Handles class imbalance using compute_class_weight\n   - Saves models in portable pickle format to `data/models/`\n   - Includes validation on `hi_small_validation.csv` to choose hyperparameters and thresholds\n\n**Next steps to complete:**\n1. Run the training script to generate the models\n2. Update `scoring/core.py` to load and use the trained models instead of the stub\n3. Create a validation script to verify models produce same scores on laptop and VM (simulated)\n4. Update `scoring/REPORT.md` with model information and performance metrics\n\nWould you like me to proceed with running the training script and continuing with the integration?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32956,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":371,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"1742e661-75ae-4215-9552-952efaea4eef","timestamp":"2026-10-17T14:50:26.664Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\R.NETHAJI\\Downloads\\ibm hack","s